          shortDescription: 'Experience the intense Austrian tradition of Bauernschnapsen. With only 20 cards in play, every card counts as you and your partner bid for high-stakes contracts. Navigate the rigid trump hierarchy and use strategic marriages to reach 66 points before your rivals can stop you.',
